  "notes": "Observed physical elements include the enlarged penthouse, louvred rooftop screen with five equipment assemblies, small flues, rounded south elbow, recessed stone base, zinc fascia, and an inferred two-storey projecting oriel on wall 0 based on the adjoining corner with wall 1. The exact oriel placement, unmeasured stack positions, and east and south bay spacing remain inferred rather than directly measured, and plant louvers and variable stone courses read weakly in render."
